<title>USA: Miller says unaware of reason for stock move.</title>
<headline>Miller says unaware of reason for stock move.</headline>
<dateline>ATLANTA 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Miller Industries Inc said Monday it is not aware of any corporate development that would explain the recent unusual activity in its stock.</p>
<p>The company said it issued this statement in response to an inquiry from the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>The company's shares traded at 14-1/4, up 1-7/8, on volume of 392,700 shares.</p>
